WEBVTT

00:10:59.938 --> 00:11:06.883
♪ when I am walking at your pace ♪ 
(mengikuti langkahmu)

00:11:06.883 --> 00:11:09.168
♪ But all I could think ♪ 
(Tapi yang kupikirkan)

00:11:09.168 --> 00:11:14.616
♪ idling through the cities ♪ 
(selagi melewati kota)

00:11:14.616 --> 00:11:18.147
♪ do I look pretty
(apakah aku terlihat cantik)

00:11:18.147 --> 00:11:21.678
♪ in the rain ♪
(di tengah hujan)

00:11:21.678 --> 00:11:25.210
♪ And I don't know how someone ♪ 
(Dan entah bagaimana seseorang)

00:11:25.210 --> 00:11:28.733
♪ quite so lovely ♪ 
(yang cukup menarik)

00:11:28.733 --> 00:11:34.391
♪ makes me feel ugly ♪ 
(membuatku merasa jelek)